**Português**

Será um prazer recebê-los e temos algumas dicas para vocês, competidores e acompanhantes:
- Chegue ao local da competição 30 minutos antes de modalidade que participará;
- O cubo que você irá competir deve estar em bom estado, portanto, cuide bem dele;
- Se tiver alguma dúvida, não hesite em perguntar. A nossa competição é formada por alguns competidores experientes, mas sempre teremos espaço para novos cubistas.
- Procure se divertir bastante!

**English**
It will be a pleasure to receive you and we have some tips for you, competitors and companions:
- Arrive at the competition site 30 minutes before the modality that will participate;
- The cube you will be competing in must be in good condition, so take good care of it;
- If you have any questions, do not hesitate to ask. Our competition is made up of some experienced competitors, but we will always have room for new cubists.
- Try to have a lot of fun!

![](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/rails/active_storage/blobs/redirect/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsibWVzc2FnZSI6IkJBaHBBc0pTIiwiZXhwIjpudWxsLCJwdXIiOiJibG9iX2lkIn19--7db1331b0dd4ce4bcba13ee8167a991060ad3cc2/Sol.png)

#![Bandera ESP](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/rails/active_storage/blobs/redirect/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsibWVzc2FnZSI6IkJBaHBBb0E5IiwiZXhwIjpudWxsLCJwdXIiOiJibG9iX2lkIn19--c7812c9b5d2929fb4ed7644517bf4f9800a3d1e4/esp.png) **Español**
Si eres socio de la **Asociación Española de Speedcubing (AES)** a día 28 de enero de 2024 y participas en la competición se te reembolsarán un 15% de la cuota de registro al finalizar ésta. Puedes hacerte socio de la AES pinchando [aquí](https://speedcubingspain.org/register/).

---

#![Bandera UK](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/rails/active_storage/blobs/redirect/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsibWVzc2FnZSI6IkJBaHBBb0U5IiwiZXhwIjpudWxsLCJwdXIiOiJibG9iX2lkIn19--2a28e3c285bf55a2606838971abb0514d0ef172c/UK.png) **English**
If you are **Spanish Speedcubing Association (AES)** member on January 28, 2024 and you participate in the competition, you will be reimbursed 15% of the registration fee at the end of the competition. You can join AES by clicking [here](https://speedcubingspain.org/register/).

**PORTUGUÊS**
A participação nessa competição requer do competidor o conhecimento dos seguintes requisitos:

1. Se inscrever através do site da WCA. A inscrição terá custo de R$ 30,00 para os competidores, pagos nos dias da competição durante o credenciamento;
2. Conhecer as regras da WCA;
3. Atentar-se ao cronograma da competição. Este ano, por conta da prova do ENEM no dia 12/11, optamos por colocar as modalidades mais tradicionais e normalmente com maior número de inscritos no primeiro dia de competição (11/11, sábado). Atenção aos formatos das rodadas e seus respectivos cortes/limites;
4. Caso queira adquirir a camiseta do campeonato, entre em contato com o organizador através do email welbertmoutta@gmail.com;
5. Para informações adicionais verifique o site da WCA ou entre em contato com o organizador via email (welbertmoutta@gmail.com).

**ENGLISH**
The participation in this competition requires the comprehension and acceptance of the following requirements:

1. Register through the WCA website.The registration fee is R$30,00 and must be paid on the days of competition during the registration;
2. Being familiar with the WCA rules;
3. Pay attention to the competition schedule. This year, due to the ENEM test on 11/12, we chose to put the more traditional events and usually with the highest number of competitors on the first day of competition (11/11, Saturday) Keep the rounds format, cutoffs and limits in mind;
4. If you want to purchase the championship t-shirt, contact the organizer via email welbertmoutta@gmail.com;
5. For additional information, check the WCA website or contact the organizer via email (welbertmoutta@hotmail.com).

![](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/rails/active_storage/blobs/redirect/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsibWVzc2FnZSI6IkJBaHBBcWxIIiwiZXhwIjpudWxsLCJwdXIiOiJibG9iX2lkIn19--95e85194e12ab35e101562e80ee9bb868babae62/image.png)
*Pela primeira vez na região Nordeste!*
*For the first time in the Northeast region!*

**Português:** 
- É imprescíndivel ter lido o [Regulamento da WCA](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/regulations/) antes desta competição;
- A taxa de inscrição terá um valor diferente dependendo de quando você se inscrever, para mais informações, favor consultar a guia [Valor da inscrição](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/competitions/CampeonatoBrasileiro2023#32167-valor-da-inscricao-registration-fee-s-value);
- Havendo qualquer dúvida, favor contactar algum dos organizadores ou Delegados listados.

---

**English:** 
- It is mandatory that you have read the [WCA Regulations](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/regulations/) before this competition;
- The registration fee will have a different value depending on when you register, to get more information about it, please check the [Registration Fee's Value](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/competitions/CampeonatoBrasileiro2023#32167-valor-da-inscricao-registration-fee-s-value) tab;
- If you still have any doubts, please contact one of the listed organizers or Delegates.

![](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/rails/active_storage/blobs/redirect/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsibWVzc2FnZSI6IkJBaHBBa0ZBIiwiZXhwIjpudWxsLCJwdXIiOiJibG9iX2lkIn19--e15184ab34fd24d15417f97a6865e9f26634d758/Logo.png)

#![Bandera ESP](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/rails/active_storage/blobs/redirect/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsibWVzc2FnZSI6IkJBaHBBb0E5IiwiZXhwIjpudWxsLCJwdXIiOiJibG9iX2lkIn19--c7812c9b5d2929fb4ed7644517bf4f9800a3d1e4/esp.png) **Español**
Si eres socio de la **Asociación Española de Speedcubing (AES)** a día 8 de octubre de 2023 y participas en la competición se te reembolsarán 10€ de la cuota de registro al finalizar ésta. Puedes hacerte socio de la AES pinchando [aquí](https://speedcubingspain.org/register/).

#![Bandera UK](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/rails/active_storage/blobs/redirect/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsibWVzc2FnZSI6IkJBaHBBb0U5IiwiZXhwIjpudWxsLCJwdXIiOiJibG9iX2lkIn19--2a28e3c285bf55a2606838971abb0514d0ef172c/UK.png) **English**
If you are **Spanish Speedcubing Association (AES)** member on October 8, 2023 and you participate in the competition, you will be reimbursed €10 of the registration fee at the end of the competition. You can join AES by clicking [here](https://speedcubingspain.org/register/).

**REGISTRO**

A participação nesta competição requer do competidor o conhecimento dos seguintes requisitos:

 1. Se inscrever através do site da WCA. A inscrição terá custo de R$ 30 e o pagamento deverá ser feito via PIX para a chave planeta.rio.open@gmail.com. O comprovante de pagamento deverá ser enviado para o mesmo email;
2. Escolher os eventos a serem registrados com cuidado após revisar as guias Eventos e Cronograma. Prestar atenção aos formatos das rodadas e seus cortes/limites;
3. Preencher o seguinte [formulário](https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSd7w5hqTt8BB-GbKildtIHah7ygjYonOWLStzRI10ndMDp8gA/viewform) para facilitar o controle dos nomes dos competidores e acompanhantes por parte da equipe do Planetário envolvida com a organização;
4. Para obterem a entrada e permanência na competição, os **acompanhantes** deverão adquirir os ingressos na bilheteria do Planetário. Cada competidor terá direito a 1 (um) ingresso no valor de meia entrada (R$10) para um acompanhante. Os demais acompanhantes, se houver, deverão pagar o valor inteiro do ingresso (R$20). **Esta taxa é aplicada somente aos acompanhantes** e deverá ser paga apenas nos dias da competição, não devendo ser feita junto a transferência PIX para o pagamento da inscrição;
5. Para informações adicionais, verifique o site da WCA ou entre em contato com o organizador através do email planeta.rio.open@gmail.com, bem como o delegado por meio do email isoares@worldcubeassociation.org;
6. Favor ler o [Regulamento da WCA](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/regulations/translations/portuguese-brazilian/) antes da competição.

 
**REGISTRATION**

The participation in this competition requires the comprehension and acceptance of the following requirements:

1. Register through the WCA website. The registration costs R$30 and must be paid via PIX transfer to planeta.rio.open@gmail.com. Proof of payment must be sent to the same email address;
2. Carefully choosing the events. Keep the rounds format, cutoffs and limits in mind;
3. Fill in the following [form](https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSd7w5hqTt8BB-GbKildtIHah7ygjYonOWLStzRI10ndMDp8gA/viewform) to help keep track of competitor and guest names by the Planetarium team involved with the organization;
4. To gain entry and stay in the competition, **guests** must purchase tickets at the Planetarium ticket booth. Each competitor will be entitled to 1 (one) ticket worth half price (R$10) for a single guest. The other guests, if any, must pay the entire ticket price (R$20). **This fee is applied only to guests only** and must be paid only on the days of the competition, and must not be made via the PIX transfer for payment of registration;
5. For additional information, check the WCA website or contact the organizer via email, (planeta.rio.open@gmail.com), or the delegate (isoares@worldcubeassociation.org);
6. Please read the [WCA Regulations](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/regulations/) before the competition.

